# GLO: a tap toggles mono / poly; held, it opens the trill page, held again the second page, again the first.
# The knobs edit the trill's feel and defaults; a tap on GLO from a trill page still toggles mono.
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 50
expect par16 1
tap GLO
wait 50
expect par16 0
press GLO
wait 600
release GLO
wait 50
expect view 5
expect par16 0
spin K1 -10
spin K2 -5
spin K4 2
wait 50
expect par15 90
expect par44 37
expect par48 2
wait 1400
shot trill.png
press GLO
wait 600
release GLO
wait 50
expect view 6
spin K1 -7
spin K2 5
wait 50
expect par46 120
expect par47 10
press GLO
wait 600
release GLO
wait 50
expect view 5
tap HOME
wait 50
expect view 0
# oroshi is set (K4 above): in ornament mode the header carries 颪, so the player knows the trill key rolls
snap home
tap SEQ
wait 1400
shot home-oroshi.png
tap SEQ
wait 1400
expect screen home
